# Line endings are a repository decision, not a per-contributor setting.
#
# Without this, whether ci/check-dependency-budget.sh works depends on the
# `core.autocrlf` value of whichever machine committed it. A shell script
# checked out with CRLF fails on Linux with `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env
# bash^M` — so the CI job breaks, with an error pointing nowhere near the cause,
# and only for some contributors.
#
# One rule covers every text file in the repository; per-extension lines would
# only restate it.
* text=auto eol=lf
